    authors: "Garms, C.G., Strimbu, B.M., et al. (2026)",
    title: "Calibrating a Low-SWaP-C Lidar–Stereo Platform: Staged Procedures, Failure Coupling, and Operational Validation",
    venue: "In preparation for Journal of Field Robotics",
    tag: "Calibration & Validation Manuscript",
    status: "In Preparation",
    takeaway: "Documents how a 2.50 mm target curl over a 320 mm span biased focal length 4.6% low and induced a 133 mm lateral / ~140 mm fore-aft extrinsic shift, resolved via a rigid flat target, external laser scale gate, and count^2.0 plane weighting.",
    bibtex: `@unpublished{garms2026cutmap_calibration,
  title={Calibrating a Low-SWaP-C Lidar--Stereo Platform: Staged Procedures, Failure Coupling, and Operational Validation},
  author={Garms, Cory G. and Strimbu, Bogdan M. and others},
