          <figcaption class="p-4 text-xs text-text-muted border-t border-border/60 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-white font-mono">Burlington White Pine Groves 1–3:</strong> Top-down <code>FAST-LIO2</code> trajectories and gravity-levelled breast-height (<code>z = 1.37 m</code>) stem maps across 65 taped eastern white pine stems.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="p-3 bg-black/40">
            <img 
              src="/images/cutmap/fig7_multi_stand_validation.png" 
