            <strong class="text-white font-mono">65-Stem Tape Validation:</strong> Full-ring stems (&ge;340&deg;, <code>n=42</code>) achieve <code>+2.84 &plusmn; 1.46 cm</code> (RMSE 3.18 cm, <code>R&sup2; = 0.9836</code>); all 65 stems achieve <code>+3.26 &plusmn; 2.53 cm</code> (RMSE 4.12 cm, <code>R&sup2; = 0.951</code>) with a partial-arc slope of <code>+2.79 cm per 100&deg;</code> of missing trunk arc.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

    </div>
